      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "This Inquisitor stands guard over the sarcophagus, his vigil in the central spire of the Twilight Praxeum unceasing.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00001",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00000",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00001": {
      "Id": "entry-00001",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Darth Revan was amongst the foremost of us all. When the Mandalorian threat arose, the stagnant Jedi Council and the corrupt Republic would not act to defend the peoples of this galaxy. It was Revan who did. It was Revan who understood that a true Jedi would have acted to protect. Yet, the fools in the Council condemned him, and we learned that the path to power, to freedom, is not one to be walked while we bore the shackles of a bloated Senate about our ankles.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00003",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00002",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00002": {
      "Id": "entry-00002",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"He convinced many of the Jedi Order to crusade against the Mandalorians. He gathered soldiers from across the galactic plane, mustered fleets that blackened the stars, and he himself led at the fore. But it was the massacre at Cathar that truly convinced the galaxy that Revan was right. After that, even the Jedi Council could not help but concede that his wisdom surpassed theirs. But they did so begrudgingly, those spiteful, hypocritical fools, so calcified in their arrogance. And they plotted, and they schemed, against him.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00005",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00004",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00003": {
      "Id": "entry-00003",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"They betrayed him, and they betrayed the galaxy. They turned on him after Revan ended the Mandalorian threat, bested the so-called Mandalore the Ultimate in single battle. It was his dream to reform the Republic, to purge the corrupt Senators that had grown swollen with riches from exploiting the galaxy, to purify the Jedi Order into something true to the Jedi Code. The wretched Council, fearing the loss of their power and influence, turned on him, and forced him to battle for his survival. That sparked the war which has engulfed the galaxy, but theirs was not the most painful of the betrayals which our Lord had to endure.\"",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00007",
          "Conditions": []
        },
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00006",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    },
    "entry-00004": {
      "Id": "entry-00004",
      "SpeakerName": "",
      "SpeakerTag": "",
      "PortraitResref": "",
      "SoundResref": "",
      "Animation": 0,
      "AnimationLoops": true,
      "Delay": 4294967295,
      "Comment": "",
      "JournalQuest": "",
      "Text": [
        {
          "Text": "\"Malak.\" The Inquisitor spits that word out with venom and spite. \"Revan's own apprentice. Malak betrayed Revan, sought to kill him, and seized control of the Empire which was Revan's by right. Traitor. Wretch. Scum. We battle now to clean that cancerous rot from the galaxy, for we will never forget, nor will we ever forgive.\" There was a forlorn look towards the sarcophagus, before the Inquisitor resumes his grim vigil.",
          "Style": 0,
          "Color": null
        }
      ],
      "OnEnterActions": [],
      "Choices": [
        {
          "ChoiceId": "reply-00008",
          "Conditions": []
        }
      ]
    }
  },
